WEBVTT

00:01.364 --> 00:03.664
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.804 --> 00:06.824
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.334 --> 00:10.074
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.074 --> 00:14.704
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.144 --> 00:22.104
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.854 --> 00:26.724
Dragon Drive

00:26.724 --> 00:32.214
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.364 --> 00:35.334
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.334 --> 00:38.564
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.064 --> 00:43.444
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.444 --> 00:45.404
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.404 --> 00:51.714
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.454 --> 00:55.814
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.814 --> 00:59.014
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.354 --> 01:04.364
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.364 --> 01:05.914
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.064 --> 01:08.464
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.464 --> 01:11.594
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.004 --> 01:17.074
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.074 --> 01:19.804
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:19.804 --> 01:27.474
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:46.064 --> 01:47.264
You're not bad.

01:47.704 --> 01:49.564
I want to help you!

01:51.344 --> 01:52.674
Go!! Chibi!!

02:04.054 --> 02:05.074
Chibi!!

02:07.554 --> 02:09.044
You can come out now!

02:09.394 --> 02:13.224
I would also like to join your team.

02:14.964 --> 02:18.334
Shadow of a Friend

02:21.974 --> 02:24.464
You're going to search for
the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons?

02:25.144 --> 02:26.034
Yeah.

02:26.104 --> 02:28.374
Kouhei still doesn't know where it is.

02:28.614 --> 02:32.414
If we can find it first,
that'll give us a chance to stop him.

02:33.284 --> 02:36.714
But if you divide
your cumulative battle strength...

02:36.884 --> 02:38.714
...you won't have a chance against RI-ON.

02:38.954 --> 02:41.924
But we can't just sit here and wait!

02:43.864 --> 02:45.484
There's no reason to worry.

02:45.594 --> 02:48.024
I'm pretty good at searching for things.

02:48.994 --> 02:49.964
Elder!

02:51.134 --> 02:55.504
Since only Meguru has been there
and she's unable to remember its location...

02:55.674 --> 02:57.164
...I guess we have no choice.

02:58.174 --> 02:59.164
Okay, then.

02:59.474 --> 03:00.444
Go on.

03:00.514 --> 03:01.734
But don't overdo it.

03:01.814 --> 03:03.934
Don't worry! We know!

03:05.944 --> 03:06.914
Oh, boy.

03:15.524 --> 03:17.784
Take care of things while I'm gone, Maiko.

03:18.294 --> 03:19.694
Sure, leave it to me!

03:24.634 --> 03:27.564
Be careful, everyone!

03:28.174 --> 03:29.574
Guys!

03:31.104 --> 03:32.574
They've gone already.

03:33.044 --> 03:34.404
Good morning, Daisuke.

03:34.514 --> 03:35.344
Darn.

03:35.414 --> 03:38.004
Those guys have some nerve
to leave without me!

03:38.314 --> 03:40.334
You and I will look after things
around here.

03:41.184 --> 03:42.044
What?!

03:43.154 --> 03:44.674
So we're housesitting again?

03:44.754 --> 03:47.414
Why am I always the one
left to here stay and housesit?!

03:49.054 --> 03:52.084
I-It's your fault for sleeping in, Daisuke.

03:53.094 --> 03:55.754
That's still no reason to leave me behind.

03:55.994 --> 03:57.364
I'm going too!

03:58.534 --> 04:01.234
Wh-What are you saying?
Have you forgotten?

04:01.304 --> 04:03.494
We've been attacked here before...

04:03.574 --> 04:06.164
...someone has to stay to protect the place.

04:06.444 --> 04:08.034
Y-You have a point.

04:08.474 --> 04:09.914
You're right!

04:10.644 --> 04:12.874
I-In any case, I'm counting on you!

04:14.314 --> 04:15.284
Maiko.

04:16.114 --> 04:18.414
She's counting on me.

04:18.654 --> 04:20.644
My Sweet Honey is counting on me.

04:20.824 --> 04:23.414
Is that right... I hadn't realized it.

04:23.594 --> 04:26.224
Then why didn't she tell me sooner?

04:26.494 --> 04:30.124
She's so cute blushing like that.

04:30.334 --> 04:32.424
Hey, why am I feeling a breeze?

04:34.304 --> 04:35.774
What's this?!

04:36.274 --> 04:37.674
I've been seen! I showed it!

04:37.744 --> 04:41.034
She saw it! She saw me!

04:42.814 --> 04:43.714
Maiko!!

04:53.254 --> 04:56.124
Where the heck is that bastard?

05:03.664 --> 05:06.394
Thanks, Mr. Taiyou, for giving me a ride.

05:06.804 --> 05:08.634
Don't mention it.

05:08.874 --> 05:11.634
You and Chibi are our
important trump card.

05:12.004 --> 05:14.904
You can make yourself useful
when the time comes!

05:30.264 --> 05:32.724
I need to think about how to use
our strength efficiently...

05:32.794 --> 05:34.664
...if I'm gonna win against Kouhei.

05:34.734 --> 05:36.824
What are you looking so gloomy about?

05:38.364 --> 05:40.494
It doesn't suit you.

05:40.804 --> 05:44.174
Rather than worry about the future,
let's talk about ourselves.

05:44.404 --> 05:45.164
Huh?

05:45.304 --> 05:46.634
Have you forgotten?

05:46.704 --> 05:49.374
I'm a big Reiji Ohzora fan.

05:49.474 --> 05:52.344
So I wanna know more about you.

05:52.714 --> 05:54.114
R-Really?

05:54.484 --> 05:56.344
The two of us are taking a journey.

05:56.554 --> 05:58.784
Let's use our time together more effectively!

05:59.454 --> 06:00.614
You're right.

06:00.694 --> 06:04.184
I also have a ton of things
I'd like to ask you, Mr. Taiyou.

06:06.264 --> 06:08.854
I don't like traveling in groups.

06:09.064 --> 06:10.724
I'm doing my part alone.

06:12.404 --> 06:13.364
Oh?

06:13.734 --> 06:17.674
Then why don't I use this opportunity
to look for that selfish lady?

06:18.174 --> 06:19.304
Sayaka Towa.

06:19.374 --> 06:21.674
What are you planning this time?

06:25.044 --> 06:26.844
How do you like it, Mr. Kouhei?

06:26.914 --> 06:28.544
Excellent, Sayaka!

06:28.654 --> 06:32.104
I never dreamed I could drink tea
this delicious in Rikyu!

06:32.184 --> 06:34.984
Thank you so much!

06:35.794 --> 06:36.754
Huh?

06:36.824 --> 06:38.384
What's wrong? Aren't you having any?

06:38.524 --> 06:39.494
It's delicious.

06:40.064 --> 06:41.994
I have no intention of drinking anything...

06:42.164 --> 06:43.594
...served by someone I don't even know.

06:43.864 --> 06:44.894
Come on!

06:44.964 --> 06:46.224
That's not nice.

06:46.334 --> 06:51.064
I made it especially for you two,
with hopes that it'll help you relax.

06:52.044 --> 06:53.234
I doubt that.

06:53.304 --> 06:55.244
Those are just words.

06:55.314 --> 07:00.074
Kouhei, that man still refuses to believe me.

07:00.654 --> 07:05.784
You know, we joined up and formed a party,
so let's try and be kind to each other.

07:06.524 --> 07:09.494
Besides, the fun part of this game
has just started!

07:10.764 --> 07:13.254
That man scares me!

07:20.634 --> 07:21.894
You tired?

07:21.974 --> 07:24.764
Ah, not really. That's not it.

07:25.104 --> 07:26.264
I'm sorry.

07:26.344 --> 07:27.744
There's no reason to apologize.

07:27.814 --> 07:30.104
I'm getting tired from talking
so much about myself too.

07:30.544 --> 07:31.774
But, you know...

07:31.914 --> 07:35.114
...we've gotta find that Shrine of
the Four Sacred Dragons, no matter what.

07:36.884 --> 07:39.284
Look over there, Mr. Taiyou!

07:41.794 --> 07:42.724
Hey!

07:42.794 --> 07:44.484
Give up and be caught already!

07:47.064 --> 07:50.364
We'd better catch it gently,
or Madam will be angry with us!

07:50.434 --> 07:53.804
But I can't help it
if it refuses to do as we tell it to!

07:53.904 --> 07:55.024
But still...

07:57.574 --> 07:59.004
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

07:59.174 --> 08:00.334
Take this!

08:01.444 --> 08:02.804
I did it!

08:07.654 --> 08:09.114
How dare you make us work so hard.

08:09.184 --> 08:12.314
Is it all right? Is it hurt?

08:12.424 --> 08:14.114
Don't worry about such details!

08:14.194 --> 08:15.314
Everything's okay!

08:20.464 --> 08:22.824
You guys! Let go of that dragon!

08:22.994 --> 08:24.394
It obviously doesn't like what you're doing!

08:25.034 --> 08:26.004
Shut up!

08:26.134 --> 08:28.004
Don't get in the way of our jobs!

08:28.074 --> 08:30.504
Why should you care what we do?!

08:30.804 --> 08:34.704
If we don't go home with it,
Madam will scold us!

08:35.144 --> 08:38.674
I don't think capturing wild dragons
living freely is a good idea.

08:38.844 --> 08:40.504
Freely, you say?

08:41.354 --> 08:44.114
These dragons belong to Madam
in the first place!

08:44.254 --> 08:48.214
What's wrong with taking them
back to her?

08:48.754 --> 08:50.314
The dragons belong to Madam?

08:50.424 --> 08:51.584
That's right.

08:51.764 --> 08:55.994
There's no one in this world
that loves dragons more than Madam.

08:56.164 --> 09:00.124
She's an incredible person who knows
everything there is to know about dragons.

09:00.234 --> 09:01.204
Mhm!

09:02.574 --> 09:05.874
That's still no reason
to forcefully capture them!

09:07.314 --> 09:09.144
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

09:09.214 --> 09:10.974
If I hear any more fussing from you...

09:11.044 --> 09:13.884
...I'll beat you up
and take that dragon from you!

09:13.954 --> 09:17.214
It appears that a peaceful solution
is not an option.

09:17.424 --> 09:19.214
What? You wanna fight us?

09:20.424 --> 09:22.394
Mr. Taiyou! I'm fighting too!

09:22.494 --> 09:23.254
It's all right.

09:23.324 --> 09:24.884
I'll take care of things here.

09:25.294 --> 09:26.554
Here I go!

09:30.194 --> 09:31.684
How's that!

09:32.004 --> 09:32.694
Damn!

09:32.764 --> 09:33.734
Chibi!

09:41.274 --> 09:42.714
Wow.

09:42.944 --> 09:44.314
Wonderful.

09:44.514 --> 09:45.574
But...

09:45.714 --> 09:47.744
Do you not care what happens to him?

09:47.814 --> 09:49.254
You're being unfair!

09:50.184 --> 09:51.774
Say whatever you wish.

09:52.484 --> 09:53.514
Reiji.

09:53.684 --> 09:55.524
It looks like they win.

09:55.994 --> 09:57.014
We'd better surrender.

10:00.364 --> 10:01.854
Reiji! Please!

10:02.634 --> 10:03.754
All right.

10:04.664 --> 10:07.434
How do you like that?!
A little too powerful for you?!

10:07.804 --> 10:09.774
Hey, make your dragon small.

10:10.074 --> 10:10.904
What?!

10:11.274 --> 10:13.434
Transforming dragons are pretty rare.

10:13.644 --> 10:15.774
I'll have you come, too.

10:16.374 --> 10:17.604
Hurry up!

10:17.984 --> 10:18.944
Chibi.

10:22.154 --> 10:23.774
Okay, that's a good boy.

10:23.854 --> 10:25.784
Now come with us.

10:26.184 --> 10:28.914
We did extra well today.

10:29.694 --> 10:31.814
Madam will be very proud of us.

10:34.264 --> 10:36.424
Hey, what are you just standing there for?!

10:36.564 --> 10:37.934
I'm not sure about this.

10:38.434 --> 10:40.294
Shall we get going, Sayaka?

10:40.574 --> 10:41.664
Yes!

10:41.734 --> 10:43.964
I'll go wherever you wish!

10:51.014 --> 10:53.244
There's another one of those pests again.

10:53.414 --> 10:54.474
What should we do?

10:55.114 --> 10:57.244
Isn't he here to find you?

10:58.524 --> 10:59.814
You must be joking.

10:59.884 --> 11:02.154
He's not on my team anymore!

11:02.594 --> 11:03.824
Hmm...

11:03.924 --> 11:05.724
Then I think I'll destroy him.

11:05.794 --> 11:07.554
I'll destroy him myself.

11:08.764 --> 11:09.994
You're serious.

11:10.394 --> 11:11.994
Can you really destroy him?

11:12.264 --> 11:14.134
Watch carefully, and I'll show you.

11:14.304 --> 11:16.364
Hopefully, I'll earn your trust after this.

11:20.274 --> 11:21.674
She's not here either.

11:25.114 --> 11:26.134
Boy.

11:26.414 --> 11:28.714
I've come all the way out here to find you
and this is how I'm treated?

11:28.784 --> 11:30.214
You must really hate me.

11:30.414 --> 11:32.544
It's not that I dislike you or anything.

11:32.624 --> 11:34.714
Just, right now, you're in my way!

11:38.224 --> 11:40.324
I have no intention of fighting against you.

11:40.594 --> 11:42.084
But I intend to fight against you!

11:44.304 --> 11:47.364
You're really quite an interesting person!

12:06.554 --> 12:08.484
Huh? You purposely got caught?!

12:08.624 --> 12:09.354
That's right.

12:09.424 --> 12:13.384
So that we can meet this so-called Madam
who knows everything about dragons.

12:13.864 --> 12:18.064
She may know something
about the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons.

12:18.364 --> 12:19.924
Good thinking.

12:20.734 --> 12:22.434
I assumed as much.

12:22.504 --> 12:24.594
That explains everything.

12:24.744 --> 12:25.604
Chibi!

12:25.674 --> 12:30.334
There aren't too many dragon masters
clumsy enough to be caught by Goetsu.

12:30.414 --> 12:32.044
That's mean, Madam!

12:32.114 --> 12:33.744
They're just being sore losers!

12:33.914 --> 12:35.444
You're such a fool.

12:35.854 --> 12:41.314
This dragon master is Sun Wols,
a former champion of Dragonic Heaven.

12:42.194 --> 12:43.624
You know me?

12:43.724 --> 12:45.624
Of course I know you.

12:45.694 --> 12:48.724
But I've never seen
this little one who can transform.

12:48.794 --> 12:49.764
Chibi!

12:49.834 --> 12:53.064
Don't get so excited, and have a seat.

12:53.734 --> 12:55.364
There's something I'd like to ask you about.

12:55.504 --> 12:56.634
Go ahead.

12:56.804 --> 12:58.604
The Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons.

12:58.804 --> 13:01.274
If you know, please tell us where it is.

13:01.774 --> 13:03.264
Four Sacred Dragons?

13:03.744 --> 13:05.174
So you do know.

13:05.514 --> 13:07.034
What do you plan to do if I tell you?

13:07.514 --> 13:09.814
We'll go there! We have to!

13:10.084 --> 13:11.784
If you go, you'll be walking
straight into a battle.

13:11.954 --> 13:13.114
We're prepared for that!

13:13.454 --> 13:16.324
If that's the case, I cannot tell you.

13:16.454 --> 13:18.394
Why not?! Tell us!

13:18.464 --> 13:20.584
If you go, you won't make it back alive.

13:20.664 --> 13:21.964
You will die for sure.

13:22.134 --> 13:24.724
We must go, even if death awaits us!

13:24.904 --> 13:27.134
Then go by yourselves.

13:27.334 --> 13:31.734
In the meantime, I'll take
good care of this little one.

13:33.044 --> 13:36.404
I feel so sorry for you...
what a cruel master you have.

13:36.644 --> 13:39.374
He hates it! Stop it!

13:40.784 --> 13:42.144
You're being rude to Madam!

13:42.214 --> 13:43.984
Let go! Let go, will you?!

13:44.154 --> 13:46.314
What are you so mad about, young man?

13:46.384 --> 13:48.154
There's nothing to worry about.

13:48.224 --> 13:50.154
Chibisuke is my friend!

13:50.254 --> 13:51.354
Give him back to me!

13:51.424 --> 13:53.154
Your friend?

13:53.424 --> 13:56.594
You were just talking about
not caring if these dragons die.

13:56.694 --> 13:59.034
How could you call them "friends"?

13:59.264 --> 14:00.634
You make me sick!

14:00.704 --> 14:01.894
What?!

14:02.004 --> 14:04.164
The destiny of this world is riding on this!

14:04.244 --> 14:06.174
Please tell us where to find the Shrine!

14:06.374 --> 14:08.574
You still don't understand.

14:08.914 --> 14:10.674
Goetsu. Let him go.

14:10.984 --> 14:11.964
Huh?! But...

14:12.044 --> 14:13.174
Just let him go!

14:13.244 --> 14:14.214
Tch!

14:14.414 --> 14:15.614
Come with me.

14:15.714 --> 14:18.844
I'll show you a paradise for these dragons.

14:19.424 --> 14:20.644
A paradise?

14:30.764 --> 14:32.064
What's this?

14:32.134 --> 14:35.624
These are the dragons that live
in the paradise I am creating.

14:35.704 --> 14:36.864
Did you kill them?

14:38.374 --> 14:40.004
Not a chance.

14:40.074 --> 14:41.904
I would never kill them.

14:41.974 --> 14:45.814
These dragons are all alive,
protected by a special film.

14:46.114 --> 14:48.674
As a result, they've obtained eternal life!

14:49.014 --> 14:50.344
As long as they remain here...

14:50.414 --> 14:53.514
...they no longer have to fight,
nor do they have to look for food.

14:53.584 --> 14:57.454
They can live eternally,
without ever suffering again!

14:57.524 --> 14:59.494
How do you expect them
to be happy with this?!

14:59.764 --> 15:02.624
Dragons are happiest living freely!

15:03.764 --> 15:08.264
Are they really happy being used
by people and fighting to their death?

15:12.004 --> 15:15.204
If they die, it all ends there.

15:18.284 --> 15:20.574
But is that reason to take
their freedom from them?

15:20.644 --> 15:22.374
This is no different from being dead!

15:22.584 --> 15:25.484
No. Here they can live forever.

15:25.554 --> 15:26.854
Stay back!

15:26.924 --> 15:30.354
Can you not hear the dragons here?

15:30.424 --> 15:31.554
They're angry!

15:31.664 --> 15:33.594
Don't be foolish.

15:33.864 --> 15:35.854
How could they be anything but happy?

15:36.094 --> 15:38.364
You're wrong! They're all angry!

15:38.534 --> 15:40.524
Stop being such a pest.

15:42.374 --> 15:44.034
Madam!

15:44.304 --> 15:46.864
Look here. I caught another one.

15:46.944 --> 15:48.604
You did well, Doushu.

15:48.714 --> 15:50.774
Take it over there and let it rest.

15:51.144 --> 15:52.114
Those guys...

15:58.354 --> 16:01.184
This is cruel... Too cruel!

16:04.694 --> 16:06.184
You're not getting away!

16:08.264 --> 16:10.634
That's enough fooling around for now.

16:14.304 --> 16:15.274
M'lady.

16:15.334 --> 16:16.664
Please return with me.

16:16.734 --> 16:18.034
You've got to be kidding!

16:18.104 --> 16:20.804
I have no choice. She's asking for it.

16:22.144 --> 16:22.944
Kouhei!

16:25.844 --> 16:27.814
Let me in on the fun!

16:28.154 --> 16:30.054
Thank you, Mr. Kouhei.

16:30.214 --> 16:31.484
Don't mention it.

16:31.654 --> 16:32.644
Hey, let's do it.

16:35.924 --> 16:38.154
Some unwanted guests.

16:38.524 --> 16:42.194
What are you thinking, Sayaka?

16:44.234 --> 16:46.164
Chibi! We've gotta save everyone!

16:55.844 --> 16:58.144
What does it take to get through to you?

16:58.314 --> 17:00.284
That's right. Good, Chibi!

17:00.384 --> 17:01.344
Reiji!

17:04.724 --> 17:06.014
Chibi!

17:09.294 --> 17:10.384
Chibi.

17:10.654 --> 17:15.184
It was cuter when it was small,
but I'll have to do with how it looks now.

17:22.134 --> 17:23.034
What's that?

17:23.434 --> 17:24.874
Let's go, Thundervolt!

17:31.684 --> 17:33.944
This is tough,
facing three opponents at once.

17:34.014 --> 17:35.244
Gotcha!

17:38.154 --> 17:39.714
Bingo!

17:46.124 --> 17:47.094
It's him.

17:49.634 --> 17:52.534
I found you, you bastard!

17:56.874 --> 17:59.894
You still refuse to fight him, Thundervolt?!

18:01.544 --> 18:03.064
Then how about this?!

18:12.784 --> 18:14.914
Where are you, Rockaku?

18:14.994 --> 18:17.284
I'm here!!

18:17.594 --> 18:19.254
Who the hell are you?

18:19.324 --> 18:20.814
Let me take a look.

18:22.434 --> 18:23.424
Y-Yakou?!

18:26.004 --> 18:28.024
No, you're!

18:28.734 --> 18:29.934
Mahiru!

18:30.234 --> 18:31.434
Is it really you, Mahiru?

18:32.244 --> 18:33.644
So you remember me.

18:33.904 --> 18:35.064
I'll give you credit for that.

18:35.274 --> 18:36.764
How could I forget?

18:37.014 --> 18:41.174
You're the only brother
of my best friend, Yakou.

18:41.384 --> 18:42.574
What do you mean, "best friend"?!

18:42.654 --> 18:43.444
What a joke!

18:43.684 --> 18:46.344
If he was your best friend,
why did you let him die?

18:46.424 --> 18:48.514
Why did you return alone?

18:51.994 --> 18:53.294
Hey, Mahiru.

18:53.424 --> 18:54.894
You want some, too?

18:54.964 --> 18:55.584
Yeah.

18:55.664 --> 18:58.654
No! Children can't have any!

18:59.334 --> 19:02.304
Rockaku! Stop teasing my brother!

19:04.774 --> 19:06.704
Mahiru. Remember this well.

19:07.074 --> 19:09.704
I'm gonna change Rikyu!

19:09.914 --> 19:12.974
I'm gonna accomplish something great
that no one has ever done before!

19:13.044 --> 19:16.244
Yeah. If we get serious,
we will be the strongest in Rikyu!

19:16.314 --> 19:17.544
No mistake about it.

19:17.654 --> 19:19.314
Yeah! That's exactly right!

19:19.384 --> 19:21.484
You got it, Yakou!

19:21.654 --> 19:24.824
Whaddaya say we start
by winning Dragonic Heaven?

19:24.894 --> 19:25.584
Huh?

19:25.664 --> 19:27.254
Why start so small?

19:27.324 --> 19:29.494
Let's do something even greater!

19:29.564 --> 19:32.554
We're gonna be together, no matter what!

19:32.634 --> 19:33.494
Yeah!

19:33.564 --> 19:36.164
Listen! That means we die together too!

19:36.234 --> 19:37.964
Yeah!

19:51.984 --> 19:54.184
You two were gonna do
something incredible.

19:54.254 --> 19:57.354
That's the last thing you said
as you went on a journey with my brother.

19:57.424 --> 19:58.984
I believed you.

19:59.064 --> 20:01.684
I believed that you would never betray
my brother no matter what happened.

20:01.764 --> 20:03.994
That you would never abandon him!

20:04.764 --> 20:06.734
But you betrayed him!

20:06.904 --> 20:11.394
You promised that you'd die together,
yet you came back alive.

20:12.074 --> 20:13.704
You saw my brother die...

20:13.944 --> 20:16.604
...and came back like nothing had happened!

20:18.544 --> 20:20.014
I will never forgive you!

20:20.084 --> 20:22.344
- Wait, Mahiru! Listen to!
- Shut up!

20:25.724 --> 20:28.384
Die! And apologize to my brother, Rockaku!

20:29.154 --> 20:31.054
Air... Blast.

20:31.264 --> 20:32.194
Bastard!

20:32.264 --> 20:34.494
I saw some serious talk going on there...

20:34.564 --> 20:36.294
...but we must discuss the present situation!

20:36.364 --> 20:38.594
Okay, why don't we continue this game!

20:40.164 --> 20:41.134
Rockaku!

20:41.374 --> 20:44.064
I will kill you! Be prepared!

20:44.274 --> 20:45.394
Wait!

20:53.914 --> 20:55.144
Mahiru.

20:55.214 --> 20:56.804
You've got it all wrong.

20:56.884 --> 20:57.874
Mahiru.

21:02.524 --> 21:04.324
Yo! Did you have fun?

21:04.624 --> 21:06.614
Did you lose your sunglasses?

21:06.694 --> 21:08.254
Those looked so nice on you.

21:10.334 --> 21:12.764
You don't have to look so scary.

21:12.964 --> 21:14.064
Stop worrying.

21:14.134 --> 21:16.164
The game has only just begun.

21:16.674 --> 21:19.604
It wouldn't be any fun
if we easily cleared it in one try.

21:25.284 --> 21:26.614
Mahiru.

21:30.784 --> 21:33.584
This isn't happening, is it, Chibi?

21:55.944 --> 21:58.684
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.684 --> 22:01.454
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.454 --> 22:05.384
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.854 --> 22:09.624
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.624 --> 22:11.784
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.264 --> 22:16.354
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.794 --> 22:20.464
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.464 --> 22:23.204
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.204 --> 22:27.164
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.514 --> 22:31.014
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.014 --> 22:34.014
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.014 --> 22:38.884
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.554 --> 22:42.294
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.294 --> 22:45.064
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.064 --> 22:49.694
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.434 --> 22:53.204
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.204 --> 22:55.874
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.874 --> 23:00.504
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.174 --> 23:05.674
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.614 --> 23:12.384
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.584 --> 23:17.314
Next time

23:17.394 --> 23:20.624
How could I have let her do that to you,
Chibi?!

23:20.694 --> 23:21.624
Very stiff!

23:21.694 --> 23:24.394
She did the same thing to
Mr. Taiyou's Lai-Lai Cocoon!

23:24.464 --> 23:26.164
What are we going to do?!

23:26.664 --> 23:29.264
Okay, we'll fight the lady!

23:29.334 --> 23:30.434
Duff up!

23:30.504 --> 23:34.564
But she's so powerful and scary...

23:34.874 --> 23:37.744
Next, on Dragon Drive, "Eternal Life".

23:37.914 --> 23:40.544
What?! The true identity of that lady is!

23:41.784 --> 23:42.184
Eternal Life

23:42.184 --> 23:44.254
Eternal Life
Really?
